   "announcedAt": "2018-02-20T14:00:57.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear Ninjas & Kunoichis,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "we are very happy to finally release our latest Shadow Tactics Patch v2.2 with a significant improvement of the loading times as well as some other fixes for the game. This time for real.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A great thanks goes out to our Steam community who helped us test the patch before rolling it out to the whole wide world. We love you. Really. No, there are no DLCs coming right now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The total patch size is approximately 2 GB.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The patch will also come to GOG, unfortunately with a little delay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We also applied the patch to the Demo (currently only updated for PC only, Mac/Linux to follow a bit later), so this may be the right time to shove Shadow Tactics in your friends' face - again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We would also like to invite you to our Discord server, which is another way of giving us your feedback in general - and definitely the best place to be amongst the first to get any glimpse of our upcoming project Codename Kartoffel:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also just opened our own subreddit, not that anybody asked:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And just in case you really don't want to miss anything about Mimimi, here's the link to our exclusive mailing list:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Mimimis",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
